{% comment %}
  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  LIFETIME — Mobile Menü-Karten (Drawer #site-menu-sidebar)
  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Ersetzt die Linkliste im mobilen Menü durch ein Karten-Menü nach dem
  IM8-Muster (ein Tap = eine Zielseite), ergänzt um das AG1-Muster
  (Trust-Seiten sichtbar im Hauptmenü). Referenz-Recherche 2026-07-27:
  IM8 (Karten-Menü), AG1 (Trust-Menü + 1 CTA), Avea (Quiz im Menü).

  §12-Entscheidungen:
  - Surface: Drawer weiß (Theme), Hero-Karte --color-surface-dark (einzige
    dunkle Fläche im Body), Karte 2 --color-surface-secondary, Duo weiß.
  - Dominantes Element: Hero-Karte (AGE&DNA-Test, Kauf-Priorität €349).
  - CTA: genau einer, Pill, sticky im Sidebar-Footer, gleiches Ziel wie
    Hero-Karte. Dunkle Klammer oben/unten, dazwischen ruhig.
  - Subtraktion: keine Icons auf Produktkarten (optionales Produktbild
    stattdessen), keine Chevrons auf Karten, Zeilen ohne Deko-Icons.
  - Icons: nur im Trust-Duo, über bestehenden Mechanismus lt-trust-icon
    (lab, stethoscope), Card-Info-Muster (Benefit-Fläche + Teal).

  Karten ohne Titel oder Link werden nicht gerendert. Der CTA wird direkt
  in sections/header.liquid im .sidebar__footer gerendert (sticky).

  ── Parameter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  s  (object) — section.settings des Headers (mc_*-Settings + Flags)
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'lt-menu-cards.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<nav class="lt-menu-cards" aria-label="Hauptmenü">
  {%- if s.mc_hero_title != blank and s.mc_hero_url != blank -%}
    <a class="lt-menu-cards__card lt-menu-cards__card--dark" href="{{ s.mc_hero_url }}">
      <span>
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_hero_title | escape }}</span>
        {%- if s.mc_hero_sub != blank -%}
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__sub">{{ s.mc_hero_sub | escape }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
      {%- if s.mc_hero_image != blank -%}
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__media">
          <img
            src="{{ s.mc_hero_image | image_url: width: 152 }}"
            alt=""
            width="76"
            height="76"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.mc_card2_title != blank and s.mc_card2_url != blank -%}
    <a class="lt-menu-cards__card" href="{{ s.mc_card2_url }}">
      <span>
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_card2_title | escape }}</span>
        {%- if s.mc_card2_sub != blank -%}
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__sub">{{ s.mc_card2_sub | escape }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
      {%- if s.mc_card2_image != blank -%}
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__media">
          <img
            src="{{ s.mc_card2_image | image_url: width: 152 }}"
            alt=""
            width="76"
            height="76"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- liquid
    assign show_tile1 = false
    assign show_tile2 = false
    if s.mc_tile1_title != blank and s.mc_tile1_url != blank
      assign show_tile1 = true
    endif
    if s.mc_tile2_title != blank and s.mc_tile2_url != blank
      assign show_tile2 = true
    endif
  -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Bleibt nur eine Kachel übrig (seit 27.07.2026: „Ärztliche Leitung" ist raus,
    die Expertenseite wird über die Blog-Bylines erreicht), dann volle Breite statt
    einer halben Kachel neben einer leeren Rasterhälfte.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if show_tile1 or show_tile2 -%}
    <div class="lt-menu-cards__duo{% unless show_tile1 and show_tile2 %} lt-menu-cards__duo--single{% endunless %}">
      {%- if show_tile1 -%}
        <a class="lt-menu-cards__tile" href="{{ s.mc_tile1_url }}">
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__tile-icon">
            {%- render 'lt-trust-icon', name: 'lab', size: 20 -%}
          </span>
          <span>
            <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_tile1_title | escape }}</span>
            {%- if s.mc_tile1_sub != blank -%}
              <span class="lt-menu-cards__sub">{{ s.mc_tile1_sub | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if show_tile2 -%}
        <a class="lt-menu-cards__tile" href="{{ s.mc_tile2_url }}">
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__tile-icon">
            {%- render 'lt-trust-icon', name: 'stethoscope', size: 20 -%}
          </span>
          <span>
            <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_tile2_title | escape }}</span>
            {%- if s.mc_tile2_sub != blank -%}
              <span class="lt-menu-cards__sub">{{ s.mc_tile2_sub | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="lt-menu-cards__rows">
    {%- if s.mc_quiz_title != blank and s.mc_quiz_url != blank -%}
      <a class="lt-menu-cards__row" href="{{ s.mc_quiz_url }}">
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__row-text">
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_quiz_title | escape }}</span>
          {%- if s.mc_quiz_sub != blank -%}
            <span class="lt-menu-cards__sub">{{ s.mc_quiz_sub | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </span>
        {%- render 'lt-menu-cards-chevron' -%}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if s.mc_blog_title != blank and s.mc_blog_url != blank -%}
      <a class="lt-menu-cards__row" href="{{ s.mc_blog_url }}">
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__row-text">
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ s.mc_blog_title | escape }}</span>
        </span>
        {%- render 'lt-menu-cards-chevron' -%}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
      <a
        class="lt-menu-cards__row"
        href="
          {%- liquid
            if customer
              echo routes.account_url
            else
              echo routes.account_login_url
            endif
          -%}
        "
      >
        <span class="lt-menu-cards__row-text">
          <span class="lt-menu-cards__title">{{ 'general.breadcrumb.account.title' | t }}</span>
        </span>
        {%- render 'lt-menu-cards-chevron' -%}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</nav>
